ttf-liberation

### --- audio/video stack ---
pipewire
pipewire-pulse
pipewire-alsa
pipewire-jack
wireplumber
qt6-multimedia-ffmpeg
gst-plugins-good
gst-plugins-bad
gst-libav

### --- gaming ---
